          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Cuban clave connects Caribbean dance music to African percussion concepts.\n\nBest study habit: **Listen to regional recordings and compare with the anchor unit.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "compared-with-mali",
      "title": "Compared with Mali",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Diaspora scenes remix anchor traditions with local dance floors, radio, and language communities. Compare accent and social context — not only tune titles."
        }
      ]
    },
